msgid "Installing Elgg on MAMP"
msgstr "Установка Elgg на MAMP"

#: ../../intro/install/mamp.rst:6
msgid "Follow the :doc:`standard installation instructions <../install>`."
msgstr "Следуйте :doc:`стандартным инструкциям по установке <../install>`."

#: ../../intro/install/mamp.rst:8
msgid ""
"On certain versions of MAMP, Elgg will either fail to install or have "
"intermittent problems while running."
msgstr ""
"На некоторых версиях MAMP установка Elgg может не завершиться или возникать "
"периодические проблемы при работе."

#: ../../intro/install/mamp.rst:11
msgid ""
"This is a known issue with MAMP and is related to the Zend Optimizer. Until "
"Zend/MAMP have resolved this issue it is recommended that you **turn off the"
